{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-6", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "舊日詩篇", "storyInfo": "緹緹與帕拉斯辭行。在獄中，贊索斯遇見了一位憤世嫉俗的老人。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g9_templetheater_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$drift_intro", "key": "$drift_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天色晚了，帕拉斯，該分頭準備了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，你真的想好了要這麼做？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。自從貝赫努先生知道我們護送的文物是仿製品後，他就把豎琴交給了隨行護衛看守，不讓我靠近一步。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今晚，他一定會派人加緊巡邏，以防出現任何意外，但到了明天的交換儀式，就不一樣了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他必須讓豎琴暴露在公共場所，這樣我們才能有機會……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在這之後呢？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之後？薩爾貢官方應該會對整樁事件進行形式化的公開道歉，私下會再派外交官與里底婭理事官溝通。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "表面上是薩爾貢使節攜米諾斯國寶逃亡，實際上兩國的相關負責人都會知道，丟失的只是一件仿製品而已。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我問的不是這個，緹緹，我只想知道你會怎麼樣。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會帶著假琴和米奧，從古道離開。米納特哈瑪儀是回不去了，赫里帕夏的衛兵肯定會滿城追捕我。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是真的被抓到了，無論是貝赫努先生還是赫里帕夏都有可能會消除對己方不利的證據，並把過錯推到米諾斯方。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只有我一直逃，薩爾貢那些位高權重的貴族才不敢擅自定調這樁“偷竊案”。我帶走的是假琴，也是真相。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了，不要勸我了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果有更好的方法，我也不想帶著一把又大又重的琴環遊泰拉啊。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回去吧，帕拉斯，讓我一個人待一會，我們明天早上再見。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-150,0", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "38_g21_skystarry_L1/38_g21_skystarry_r1/38_g21_skystarry_L2/38_g21_skystarry_r2", "solidwidth": "1280/1280/1280/1280", "solidheight": "720/720/720/720", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 60.0, "yFrom": 360.0, "yTo": 720.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "緹緹靠在廣場觀眾席的椅背上抬頭看。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "在米諾斯，夜空總是晴朗通透，深得觀星愛好者青睞。也正因這得天獨厚的優勢，自古以來米諾斯人都會將英雄與星辰的位置對應。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "很小的時候，緹緹的父親會一邊望著星空，一邊跟她講英雄的故事。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "有些能從書裡找到，而沒有出處的那些，它們或許是這個在功業上毫無建樹、單單愛好文學的父親胡編亂造的。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "儘管後來病痛過早地將他帶離人世，但緹緹現在還能清晰地記起父親講述的每一個故事。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "在那些故事裡，在米諾斯的故事裡，會不會存在著一位帶著假琴逃亡的英雄？", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "千萬星辰沉默地在夜空中閃爍，緹緹沒有找到答案。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 23.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g13_generalroom_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$nervous_intro", "key": "$nervous_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "都這麼晚了，早過了我的下班時間，有什麼事明天上班再說——", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理事官的執筆人先生，是我。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "實在抱歉，我知道現在是您的休息時間。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃……您深夜造訪所為何事？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想問您，對於贊索斯師徒的盜竊案，里底婭理事官有沒有跟您說過什麼？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "稍早時我造訪理事官辦公室與里底婭小姐商議戲劇儀式的劇目，提到前幾天發生的那樁案件時，她態度模糊。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，里底婭理事官想必有自己的考量。明天就是文物交換儀式，她不僅需要處理流程問題，還要應付薩爾貢使節團。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這正是我擔心的。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果薩爾貢使節團以影響兩國信任關係為由，要求重新定調此案件，負責外交事宜的里底婭理事官幾乎無法拒絕。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "商談的時候，我能看出她的神情有些緊張，一旁的辦公桌上堆放著米諾斯法律大全和事件調查報告。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她很有可能已經受到使節的脅迫。這樣一來贊索斯師徒的罪名只會更重，而且……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果不是因為您感染礦石病的同窗危在旦夕，我想您家的沙發扶手後面，應該也不會有一條沃爾珀的尾巴。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "終於見面了，羅德島辦事處的負責人，萊娜小姐。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您好，卡珊卓拉小姐……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯和呂刻伊昂是萊娜小姐的病人，她只是想送藥給獄中的兩人，所以才會找我幫忙。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "找您幫忙？如果只是普通監管所，萊娜小姐想要為犯人寄送藥物並不困難。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來我的猜測並無太大差錯，里底婭理事官為了滿足薩爾貢使節的要求，確實準備重判，贊索斯師徒很有可能現在已經被關入死牢。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我從未想到恩底彌翁神殿專司解夢的卡珊卓拉祭司，竟然如此擅長推理……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是赫卡德墨先生您應該知道，哪怕是以理事官執筆人的身分，也無法探視死牢中的囚犯。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除非您動了極為危險的念頭，比如說——", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "劫獄。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不能讓呂刻伊昂他們因為礦石病急性發作死在牢裡。他們確實做錯了事，但判罰太重。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，今天晚上您沒有拜訪過我的住處，也從來不知道盜竊案重判一事……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能否請您幫我們隱瞞？如果眾英雄正在天穹注視我們，他們也不會坐視如此不合理的事情發生。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐也是為了救人？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要救我的病人，也要“救”我的妹妹。我明白她在理事官的位置上有抱負，也有苦衷，但她不能一錯再錯……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天的交換儀式會吸引很多民眾的目光，我已經想辦法透過私人關係拿到了監獄的設計圖，規劃好了路線。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要能帶他們出來，甚至只是幫他們打一針急性感染抑制劑都好……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "光有路線規劃還不夠，您需要人手幫您在理事官辦公室和死牢這兩處爭取時間。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會去找里底婭，至於獄警那裡……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可以幫你們。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g14_yanprison", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老先生，您說沒有東西是完完全全屬於米諾斯人自己的……怎麼可能？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，我們放牧用的馱獸，見過吧？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "罩在那些傢伙的頭上，用來控制視野的頭巾和面罩，是不是來自薩爾貢？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，您對那些頭巾的象徵意義有所不知，那其實是——", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，別跟我說什麼“這是用來影射侵占時期薩爾貢人逼迫我們穿戴頭巾”。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "譏諷和歌頌有什麼區別？不都是他們在米諾斯文化裡留下的痕跡？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這怎麼能混為一談……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不服氣？那再說說我們腳下的這片土地。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幾百年前，米諾斯是扎根土壤、依傍天然河流的樂土，現在呢？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“對岸女王”瑪拉帕夏募集薩爾貢和米諾斯的工程師，還有無數勞力，將三座城邦搬到鋼鐵履帶之上，雅賽努斯城早已駛離了它的原址。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老先生，您明顯在偷換概念，哪怕沒有薩爾貢人，我們遲早也會把自己的城邦搬上移動地塊，這只是科技發展的必然趨勢……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，說得好！小伙子在題羅斯神殿待過吧？不過啊，你忽略了一點——哪怕就是現在，你與我爭辯時使用的語言都是“混血兒”。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傳統米諾斯語在薩爾貢侵占期間早已流失，那些祭司苦思冥想拼湊成的現代米諾斯語中，你猜會有多少詞來自你們仇視的國家？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夠了！", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你沒有聽懂老先生的意思，呂刻伊昂。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "戰爭的痕跡無法消弭，一份停戰協議不代表一切都過去了，我們無法為自己心中的米諾斯奮鬥，因為它早就不存在了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "戴頭盔的，你倒是有點意思。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "按照年齡推算，您不可能是侵占時期的親歷者，但剛剛您說的話透露出您十分瞭解侵占時期的事……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要把寶貴的時間用在揣測陌生人的來歷上。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是一個死在街上跟死在獄裡並無區別的流浪漢，曾經有個還算不錯的兒子，但他被夢拐跑了。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夢？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "九年前的一個早晨，他從自己的房間跑出來，把我從宿醉中搖醒，說他夢到了一條河，他該啟程了。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一條染血的河，呵，就算不拜訪恩底彌翁神殿的祭司，我也能解讀出它的意思。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那小子不是想擺脫我，就是想上戰場想瘋了。他忘了我們家祖先經歷過什麼，也忘了他父親是怎麼會變成酗酒好賭的廢人的。", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "神諭……染血的河……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……您是伊薩科斯的父親？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g6_athenusalley_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$warm_intro", "key": "$warm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6, "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹！怎麼這麼晚才回來？我還以為你已經“畏罪潛逃”了呢。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們可能真得畏罪潛逃了，米奧。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？！你在外面逛了那麼長時間就想出來這麼個辦法，還要我陪你一起受苦？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帶著假琴遠走他鄉，把所有錯都歸為一次個人的“偷竊行為”，這是我能想到的最好的解決方法了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你想的根本不是最好的解決方法，而是最“梅捷緹克緹”的解決方法！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三週前使節團離開薩爾貢，你說自己是為了體驗克瑞斯拉初到雅賽努斯的路線，所以寧願辛苦也要沿古道走。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你明明是看出了貝赫努帶著手下的護衛排擠你，為了不鬧出矛盾，又擔心他們對文物照顧不周，所以才搬著又大又重的豎琴獨自離開。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有，幾個月前在米納特哈瑪儀，為了幫佩佩那個丫頭解圍，你往自己身上倒了整整一瓶葡萄酒。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們認識之後，你一直跟我抱怨這件事，你說博物館館長的薪水根本不高，衣物乾洗費貴得要死。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你從沒有說佩佩一句不是，反而覺得那是自己身為朋友應該做的。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你想出來的解決方法最後都只會委屈自己，那還不如乾脆別管了！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "笑什麼！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒什麼，只是我聽你這麼說了之後，更覺得自己的做法沒有錯。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就像贊索斯和呂刻伊昂先生，他們不想讓一件本該歸還米諾斯的文物變成某種外交籌碼，所以決定盜琴，並承擔一切後果。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我並不瞭解他們真正的想法，但我認為他們的事蹟同樣可以寫進英雄故事。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在，我只是一個“效仿者”。我不敢說自己理解了何為英雄氣概，但我想創造自己的故事——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕我算不上“英雄”，哪怕故事的主人公只能逃亡。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "很意外，梅捷緹克緹小姐，您能有這樣的覺悟……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您不責怪盜琴的贊索斯師徒？要是沒有那樁事故，您本可以順利完成文物交換，哪怕您手中的是一把假琴。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼會怪他們？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然我猜貝赫努先生為了先發制人，一定會向里底婭理事官施壓，讓贊索斯先生他們受到不公正的判決……但他們才是讓真相浮現的人。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是我帶走假琴能轉移矛盾的焦點，讓贊索斯和呂刻伊昂先生脫困，那也就值得了……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，卡珊卓拉小姐，您怎麼知道薩爾貢使節團帶來的琴是仿製品？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請跟我來，梅捷緹克緹小姐。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}